stable\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.1.stable.mono - Windows 11 (build 26100) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1080 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.7283) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i3-9100F CPU @ 3.60GHz (4 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nIn certain circumstances (requires specific window scaling, resolution, font) a character is cut off in the ItemList items.\n\nNote how the final \"h\" in \"High\" is cut off:\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/10e100cb-fafa-411d-845b-fed37a8381ef)\n\nAdding an \"m\" after \"High\" renders fine:\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/671ff082-5308-4c70-94c2-f45c54e8213e)\n\nIt also renders fine in the editor:\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/46e58647-0e93-4c88-9040-2b665ba3d4ad)\n\nI think the issue is related to #102581 and the associated fix.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nCreate an item list with a certain font and window resolution. See the MRP for an example.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[new-game-project.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/20471395/new-game-project.zip)\nResize the window until the \"h\" at the end of \"High\" gets cut off.","closed_by":{"login":"Joy-less","id":65855333,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1ODU1MzMz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65855333?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less","html_url":"https://github.com/Joy-less","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-le